{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "139",
 "name": "Adder's Nest",
 "file": "Map139_Adders_Nest.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Corbelled stone supports the tunnel's vaulted ceiling, straining against the pull of gravity attempting to collapse the passage beneath the weight of the mountain.  A thin layer of ice covers the path, making the floor slick and treacherous.  Sculpted from the walls, a pair of frost-coated pillars glitter in the pale light shed by a glowing crystal embedded in the carved granite door."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":2,"x":40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["The rough texture of the stone walls is further marred by gouges and scorch marks.  Splintered bones and broken axes give mute testimony to a battle here in the past.  Chipped columns support a lintel over an elaborately carved granite door.  Set heart-high on a tall Elf, a glowing crystal embedded in the door bathes the area with an eldritch light."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map135_Dark_Burrows.xml"},
  {"id":3,"x":20,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Barren walls radiate cold that bounces off the frosty tunnel floor.  The icy path reflects countless shades of white rippled with the dark shadows of stone.  Small ice chips crunch loudly underfoot with each stride over the treacherously slick surface."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":20,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Frost coats everything with layer after layer of a fine film of ice.  The twisting confines of the frozen tunnel alarmingly amplify insignificant sounds, broadcasting to anyone within earshot.  Nearly effaced murals are impossible to decipher, reduced to faint suggestions of sinuous curves and lines scrolling across the walls."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":40,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Turning sharply, the tunnel blocks a clear view in either direction.  Trickling water has frozen in ripples down the curving black granite walls, sheathing the stone in a natural mirror of ice.  The outrageously distorted reflections are distracting at best, the hints of movement and unfamiliar shapes playing up fear of the unknown."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":40,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Slick as glass, the steeply sloping tunnel is treacherous and unwelcoming.  Rimed with a sparkling veil of frost, the granite walls magnify and reflect light into a shimmering dance of icy brilliance.  Whispers of marginally warmer air swirl through the frigid passage, releasing wisps of mist.  Re-freezing swiftly, the frozen particles float until adhering to the stone like fat snowflakes, giving the black granite a lacy appearance."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":40,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Imposing walls of stone sheathed in ice leech the very warmth from the air.  Sounds are muffled by the thick blanket of frost covering the floor and echoes die quickly in the close confines of the tunnel.  Sculpted from the mountain, frost-coated pillars glitter in the pale blue light shed by a glowing crystal embedded in the carved granite door."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":60,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Shallow Cave","descriptions":["Shrouded in frost and ice, the bones of some creature gleam pale against the dark stone.  There is no sign of what brought death to this desolate place, but the splintered remains indicate that it was no peaceful ending.  Fresh air enters the cave from a vertical crack, carrying with it a crisp chill that fogs the breath.  Incongruous in this natural setting, a carved granite door at the back of the cave leads into the unknown depths of the mountain."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map137_Hags_Crag.xml"},
  {"id":9,"x":0,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Resonating from the dark depths comes the sound of howling wind, perhaps the result of a passage leading out of the mountain.  The curving walls of this portion of the tunnel were sculpted from the surrounding stone.  Several monstrous serpents, their broad heads turned to the floor, appear to be emerging from the icy granite."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":10,"x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Twisting around a sharp turn, the tunnel disappears into the darkness.  Frequent blasts of icy wind course through the area, their origins unknown.  Footing is treacherous on the icy floor, demanding careful movement.  A slight misstep could easily end in a sudden fall onto the hard, unforgiving stone."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":11,"x":-20,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Glossy with ice, the floor exudes a pressing cold that instantly penetrates clothing and goes bone deep.  Traces of banded carvings decorate the dark granite walls.  Rising at a steep grade, the floor has been shallowly scored to provide traction.  Most of the grooves have been worn smooth, either by the wind channeled through the tunnels or by the passage of others."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":12,"x":-20,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Cold seeps from the floor and walls with an amazing capacity to chill to the bone in this desolate combination of stone and lethal ice.  Tunnels branch off in several directions and elevations, leading deeper into the bowels of the mountain.  Icy breaths of wind whisper through the passageways, disturbing crystals of frost and sending them swirling through the air in a gentle mockery of falling snow."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":13,"x":0,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Clouds of misty vapor and ice particles cling to the floor, further complicating traversing the slick stone.  Rising out of the whirling mists are granite walls sculptured with thick, spiraling bands.  Indistinct hissing echoes softly, a sibilant murmur carried by the chill breeze whispering through the tunnel."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":14,"x":20,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["The omnipresent ice is much thicker in this portion of the tunnel, deep enough to envelop two frost-encrusted skeletons half-embedded the walls.  One boney arm protrudes from the frosty depths to point almost accusingly at the ceiling, where icicles of every size and length hang in dense, glittering clusters."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":15,"x":0,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Dead End","descriptions":["Despite the chill that oozes from the walls, a serene tranquility enfolds the cul-de-sac and lends the area an almost reverent quality.  A layer of ice sets the black stone aglitter with reflected light, as if the tunnel were coated in brittle glass.  After the winds whispering constantly through the upper tunnels, sounds that should echo loudly are unnaturally hushed as if muffled by the heavy air."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":16,"x":-20,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Chiseled floor to ceiling, an artistic splendor of spiral lines illustrates adders slithering through garlands of withered grapevines.  Underfoot, the slick ice covering the floor demands careful movement.  Anyone who fell and broke something could lie unaided for a long time, at the mercy of the elements and whatever creatures may prowl these subterranean tunnels."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":17,"x":0,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Shaped by man and nature, this domed chamber has been hollowed out of the mountain and the walls burnished smooth as marble.  On one side of the room, a stone staircase curves up to a circular aperture leading into darkness.  Carrying wisps of chill vapor, a vague current of air swirls down the stairwell."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":18,"x":20,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["The walls are carved with the semblance of suspended shields.  Water seeps in a maze of rivulets down the cold stone, freezing into crystalline traceries accentuating the chiseled decorations.  The frigid air is thick with a stale taste, making breathing labored and painful."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":19,"x":40,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Dead End","descriptions":["A surging sea of icy vapor fills this circular chamber, long tendrils of mist swirling upwards as if seeking an exit.  Ice shimmers blue and white against the black granite, tracing the curving pillars sculpted from the walls to support the concave ceiling.  The deep gouges marring the pillars are jarring notes in this place of stark and cold beauty."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":20,"x":0,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Dark Shaft","descriptions":["Flickering light from the opening above is diffused by swirling vapors, faintly illuminating the great black shaft plunging deep into the earth.  Huge stones have been set into the curving walls as steps, circling down and down into the bowels of the mountain."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":21,"x":-20,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Hewn from the granite mountain, the polished ceiling soars high overhead.  Lightly coated with frost, an immense inscription spans the northern wall.  The letters are as tall as a man, in archaic script.  Several tunnels exit the cavern in many directions, a labyrinthine maze of passages."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":22,"x":-60,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Gleaming particles of ice coat the tunnel, sparkling like faceted gems.  The frosty display catches and magnifies even feeble light until the area is bathed a soft azure glow.  Crystalline snowflakes drift down from the ceiling, adding an impression of movement to the prismatic play of light."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":23,"x":-40,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Dead End","descriptions":["Terminating in a blank wall, this cul-de-sac is small and cramped with thick layers ice obscuring even a hint of the mountain's black granite.  Revealed by the play of light are dim shapes caught within the translucent blue ice covering the walls, the floor and even the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":24,"x":-40,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Slick from the cold damp air, passage through the narrowing tunnel is treacherous and daunting.  A thin layer of ice covering the ground shows curiously wavy scuffs, as though some large, shapeless mass dwells within these claustrophobic depths of ice and stone."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":25,"x":-20,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Mined untold ages ago and bearing all the hallmarks of deliberate architectural planning, the tunnel curves sinuously around a bend.  The walls are smooth and lightly decorated with the lacy skeins of ice spinning across the granite like the elaborate webs of some bizarre, elemental spider."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":26,"x":-40,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["A thin layer of hoarfrost coats everything, and breath steams in the frigid air.  The tunnel runs fairly straight in either direction, as far as the eye can see, though it varies greatly in elevation.  From all around comes a chill breeze, carrying an icy vapor that clings to flesh and stone alike."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":27,"x":-40,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Bas-relief carvings form knots of ornamentation on the granite walls.  Each knot is composed of writhing adders entwined in a tangle, their crystal eyes gleaming with a cold, blue light.  Despite the deadly cold, the air still carries a faint smell as of an open grave."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":28,"x":-20,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["The tunnel walls are rough but the solid rock floor is slick and almost glistening.  The glossy layer of ice makes footing on the steep slope even more uncertain.  Further down the tunnel, the black granite walls become smoother, as if polished."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":29,"x":0,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Adder's Nest, Frozen Tunnels","descriptions":["Recessed into an arched alcove is a granite door embedded with a softly glowing crystal.  The lintel of the arch is skillfully carved with a fancifully rendered sunburst, although a thick layer of frost makes it difficult to ascertain the details.  Even the suggestion of warmth from a graven image is ruthlessly smothered by the icy cold."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":30,"x":20,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Dirge's Solace, Garden of Souls","descriptions":["Blue icicles cascade down the walls onto the white drifts of frost covering the floor.  Carved from grey ice, a banshee clad in a tattered funereal shroud stands with her head thrown back in a soundless wail while snow adders writhe about her feet.  The tinkling of shattering ice is accompanied by the eerie fluting of the winds directed by holes drilled into the cavern walls.  A carved granite door is set in one cavern wall, leading deeper into the mountain."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map138_Asketis_Mount.xml"},
  {"id":33,"x":20,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Temple of the North Wind, Catacombs","descriptions":["Wisps of mist rise up to the coffered ceiling of carved granite, riding gusts of frigid air rising from the yawning pit in the center of the floor.  Flickering lamps placed in shallow recesses provide scant illumination, giving life to the shifting shadows as the light reflects off the swirling vapors and ice-slicked walls.  A moaning whisper soars to a cacophonous scream as the cold wind rushes up from the depths, only to fade again to a nearly inaudible murmur."],"exits":[],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map140_Catacombs.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"Ice Adder","x":30,"y":-180,"z":0},
  {"text":"Ice Adder","x":-70,"y":10,"z":0}
 ]
}
